00:17:04.099 --> 00:17:05.015
NICK ORLOVE: Oh, nice.

00:17:05.015 --> 00:17:08.030
CHRIS TALBOTT: So we
know probably anywhere

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:11.416
from a third to half
of the workloads

00:17:11.416 --> 00:17:13.040
in a typical enterprise
