00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:23.388
And I'll talk about
a couple of customers

00:19:23.388 --> 00:19:26.560
in a second that are
using it in that manner.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.840
Lots of folks have a
transfer process today that's

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:31.200
usually disparate, very manual.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.900
You're collecting tapes.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.740
You're restoring those tapes.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:38.245
You may be pulling data from
a [INAUDIBLE] source on prem.

00:19:38.245 --> 00:19:40.870
And then you're kind of getting
