00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:17.709
because you're FCC
regulated, for instance--

00:20:17.709 --> 00:20:20.250
you can move that data to the
Cloud using Transfer Appliance.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.339
NICK ORLOVE: OK.

00:20:21.339 --> 00:20:22.630
CHRIS TALBOTT: So I mentioned--

