content from far away.

00:28:28.600 --> 00:28:30.730
And let's see how fast
Google Cloud Storage

00:28:30.730 --> 00:28:31.810
can get it to them.

00:28:31.810 --> 00:28:32.500
NICK ORLOVE: Put it to the test.

00:28:32.500 --> 00:28:32.830
CHRIS TALBOTT: Yeah.

