great.

00:28:58.200 --> 00:29:03.240
So we can choose Belgium region.

00:29:03.240 --> 00:29:05.174
NICK ORLOVE: OK.

00:29:05.174 --> 00:29:06.840
CHRIS TALBOTT: Oh,
I'll have to continue

00:29:06.840 --> 00:29:08.394
my Google Cloud [INAUDIBLE].

00:29:12.190 --> 00:29:16.794
So first, I will
create a bucket.

00:29:16.794 --> 00:29:19.210
Actually, for the sake of time,
I'm looking at the screen,

