I'm going to use one of the
buckets I've already created.

00:29:20.800 --> 00:29:21.466
NICK ORLOVE: OK.

00:29:21.466 --> 00:29:23.730
CHRIS TALBOTT: So if
we go back to this,

00:29:23.730 --> 00:29:25.210
let's see if I have one that's
