00:30:00.254 --> 00:30:00.920
NICK ORLOVE: OK.

00:30:00.920 --> 00:30:01.550
As you would.

00:30:01.550 --> 00:30:03.370
CHRIS TALBOTT: As we would.

00:30:03.370 --> 00:30:05.515
So I'm going to ask--

00:30:08.070 --> 00:30:10.955
once I reconnect this shell--

00:30:10.955 --> 00:30:13.330
I'm essentially going to ask
