NICK ORLOVE: OK.

00:30:20.929 --> 00:30:22.720
CHRIS TALBOTT: So I
have the script already

00:30:22.720 --> 00:30:23.680
run this time, Pearl.

00:30:23.680 --> 00:30:27.100
It's going to essentially
give me that information.

00:30:27.100 --> 00:30:28.360
And we will wait a second.

00:30:28.360 --> 00:30:31.354
And then, here you can
