00:30:36.070 --> 00:30:37.490
But with Google
Cloud Storage, we

00:30:37.490 --> 00:30:38.740
can do this much, much faster.

00:30:38.740 --> 00:30:40.390
Because we have edge
caching actually

00:30:40.390 --> 00:30:42.830
built into our solution.

00:30:42.830 --> 00:30:45.215
So once I share
