00:30:54.130 --> 00:30:54.530
CHRIS TALBOTT: Yeah.

00:30:54.530 --> 00:30:55.279
That's incredible.

00:30:55.279 --> 00:30:57.965
And it's like 99 something
percent, probably.

00:30:57.965 --> 00:30:59.290
NICK ORLOVE: Yeah.

00:30:59.290 --> 00:31:01.300
CHRIS TALBOTT: So because
the GCS recognized

00:31:01.300 --> 00:31:03.940
that I'm the user who's
